          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mild Backlash",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You glimpse the thrum of energy—the heat of a body, the flickering of synapses, the light of a soul—in a beautiful, captivating dance. You become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "88ca1b7b-d5de-5978-9ff4-258c9aadef1a"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with one creature you just affected with your deviant ability; if multiple creatures would qualify, the GM chooses. This fascination lasts for 1 minute or until the target uses a hostile action against you or your allies, as normal."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Moderate Backlash",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
