            "text": " Your fascination with the target causes you to forget your allies. As mild backlash, but you don't treat anyone as your ally (though they might still treat you as theirs), meaning that the fascination ends only if your target uses a hostile action against you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Severe Backlash",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " Your mind is filled with the single, all-consuming desire to feed upon the target. You become "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
